n with visible handles or controls that the villain grips. In Frame 6, he is shown intensely focused while steering the vehicle, which has colorful accents (blue and orange) and seems to be designed for speed and maneuverability in the snowy environment.\n\n**Pursuit Scene:**\nThe pursuit takes place in a snowy, icy landscape with cliffs, ice formations, and snow-covered ground. The villain is shown in close-up (Frame 1) and then in his vehicle (Frames 2, 3, 6), indicating he is actively chasing someone. In Frame 7, a flaming arrow is shown flying through the air, suggesting the villain may be using projectiles or weapons during the chase. Frame 8 shows a small vehicle (possibly the one being pursued) speeding across a vast icy plain, emphasizing the scale of the chase. Frame 9 provides a wider view, showing the villain’s vehicle approaching a group of characters (including a green dinosaur) who are gathered on a snowy plateau near an icy cliff.\n\n**Characters Being Followed:**\nThe prince, princess, and green dinosaur are visible in the frames as the targets of the pursuit. In Frame 4, a large green dinosaur is seen among a group of colorful characters in a snowy setting, suggesting they are part of the group being chased. In Frame 5, two characters (a pink creature and a yellow dinosaur-like figure) are shown in a vehicle, possibly the same one being pursued by the villain. In Frame 9, the green dinosaur and other characters are seen on the snowy plateau, with the villain’s vehicle approaching them, confirming they are the ones being followed.\n\nIn summary, the green-skinned villain is using a high-speed, open-top vehicle to pursue a group of characters, including a prince, princess, and green dinosaur, through a snowy, icy landscape. The chase is dynamic, with the villain actively steering his vehicle and possibly using weapons like flaming arrows to try to catch his targets.\n"], 'condensed_response': '**Condensed Scene Summary (Frames\u202f1635‑2200)**  \n\n|